  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trust Fund Bank Privat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trust Fund Bankprivatis.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IFC tillsammans med finansministeriet i Federationen, BiH, har bett Sida om hj&#xe4;lp till TA vid privatiseringen av bankgruppen Privredna Banka Sarajevo. Sarajevo Privatisation Venture kommer att omstrukturera och &quot;&#xe5;terkapitalisera&quot; bankgruppen och sedan slutligen s&#xe4;lja den till utl&#xe4;ndska investerare. TA best&#xe5;r av finansiella och juridiska konsultinsatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the help of substantial technical assistance and with some investements from IFC and DEG, the SPV Sarajevo Privatisation Venture will re-capitalize and restructure the PBS-banks, and eventually sell them to a foreign investor. IFC has together with the Ministry of Finance in the Federation applied to Sida for financing of the technical assistance (TA) in this process.</narrative>
  </description>
